WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.786
Bilisi ye min kɛ. O tun ye maana dɔ ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.880
Wagati tɛmɛninw na, Makina dugu kɔnɔ, sagaw ni baw tun be to ka mara kɛnɛgbɛ la.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.576
Ni Bilisi tun tɛ yen, o jamana tun be se ka kɛ hɛɛrɛ la.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.122
Bilisi tun ye mɔgɔ fariman dɔ ye. A tun ka fisa n'a ye ani a tun be baara kɛ n'u ye tile kɔnɔ.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.090
A tun be dumuni kɛra, ka dumuni kɛ. O kɔ, a tun b'a fɛ ka dumuni wɛrɛ kɛ fana.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.840
A y'a ka sariya labato.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.712
Ni mɔgɔ tun b'a fɛ ka begɛn dɔ faga, a tun ka kan k'a ninyɔrɔ sɔrɔ.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.352
A ta baaradenw tun bɛ yaala fan bɛɛ ra, o ma foyi to kɔngɔtɔw ye.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:48.474
Hamadi tun ye sagagbɛnbaga kanbelen dɔ le ye. A tun b'a ta fanibon kɔnɔ, a tun bɛ den fitininw fari fagako flɛra.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.656
O kɔ, a ye miiriya dɔ sɔrɔ.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:58.086
A b'a fɛ ka koo bɛɛ kɛ a ɲɛɛ na wa? A bena a sɔrɔ.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.496
Nka su fɛ, o ka domuniba dɔ tobi k'a fa simankisɛ ra.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:22.242
O kɔ, o ka turu kasadiman dɔ kɛ a ra. A tun ka ɲi yɛrɛ le.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.900
N'a y'o faamu, mun lo bena kɛ do?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.856
A be sogo dɔrɔn lo filɛ.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:53.304
Ayiwa, lon min na o tun bɛ sarakaba bɔ Matigi Ala ye, Hamadi k'a ɲa biri dugu ma ka Bilisi ta siman di.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:58.720
Bilisi k'a domu o yɔrɔnin bɛɛ, a ma foyi kɛ.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:05.026
O ye pikiri ye! A kɛra i n'a fɔ a wulenna.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:14.064
A siɲɛ fɔlɔ la, mɔgɔ bɛɛ y'a daminɛ ka yɛlɛ a ma.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:28.144
Mɔgɔjugu min koo man di mɔgɔ ye, o tigi tɛ siran tugun.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.168
U y'a lɔgɔbɔ ani a bɔra jamana na.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:49.984
Ayiwa, o lon yɛrɛ ra, an ka sogo taran ka kaɲa ni sariya ye, k'a di denbaya bɛɛ ma.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:09.092
Kabi o tuma, u b'a fɔ ko: "Bilisi ta ye". Fanga be mɔgɔ min na, o tigi b'o le ta.
